    "detailed_description": "This is an ancient land forsaken by the gods, where the glorious magic civilization has long decayed. Countless magic ruins and ancient relics still disturb this world, causing mysterious events, wild animal madness, monster rampage, and human struggle in this turbulent world.<br><br>As a death row inmate, you are given a chance to atone for your sins: sign a pardon and join the suicide squad to quell the disasters across the land, in exchange for your liberty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/5bff2fe5b6cefc8f77cb50bde9cebc95.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/9363e2cb9d20b73f6b6f284b5fd9dd65.poster.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/9363e2cb9d20b73f6b6f284b5fd9dd65.webm?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/9363e2cb9d20b73f6b6f284b5fd9dd65.mp4?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Randomly generated dungeons and caves, each adventure is a unique experience, full of surprises and scares. No matter how experienced you are as an &quot;Atoner&quot;, monsters can always jump out from unexpected corners.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/4fca0b00911c5a81720b847674d11bf2.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/2911559b3ccf1ce305e81101e553e22f.poster.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/2911559b3ccf1ce305e81101e553e22f.webm?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/2911559b3ccf1ce305e81101e553e22f.mp4?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Atoners&quot; are ruthless\uff01Blocking, comboing, executing, any enemy that stands in your way to freedom will be annihilated.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/7f9cae80958958736d8503d4a9be4d7b.poster.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/7f9cae80958958736d8503d4a9be4d7b.webm?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/7f9cae80958958736d8503d4a9be4d7b.mp4?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each weapon has its own unique skill, so choose your weapon and upgrade path carefully according to your preference, try different relic combinations and rich options, and you will become a great monster killer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/9dab01c7eecd5e52e8dfbe56add07fb9.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/6059f79e58f00f4d9b7642f5ffc62ae2.poster.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/6059f79e58f00f4d9b7642f5ffc62ae2.webm?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/6059f79e58f00f4d9b7642f5ffc62ae2.mp4?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After dealing with tons of monsters and brilliant puzzles, you will face monster bosses in the depths of the dungeons. They are huge, twisted, and evil, with unique attack patterns and devastating power, they will pose a harsh challenge to your combat skills and strategies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/0c625472943747ac5eb1554018fe37ac.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/172c9284cb41c2d3f50eda755c197720.poster.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/172c9284cb41c2d3f50eda755c197720.webm?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/172c9284cb41c2d3f50eda755c197720.mp4?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After the &quot;divine disappearance&quot;, the end of the law era, human society collapsed. By exploring this world deeply, you will find fragments of the lost civilization, and gradually piece together the truth behind The Lost Epoch.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/0f6f4b15cc902a609dfd7234dc8ef278.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=70 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/2d29a4bc308238be48c95a7ba959a2e7.poster.avif?t=1721099196\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/2d29a4bc308238be48c95a7ba959a2e7.webm?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653870/extras/2d29a4bc308238be48c95a7ba959a2e7.mp4?t=1721099196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this cruel world, you are lucky to have a place to rest. Here you can craft weapons and equipment, making your exploration journey easier, you can also make various furniture and decorations, making your cottage a cozy haven after bloody battles.",
